WEBVTT

00:06:29.463 --> 00:06:31.163
penolakan,

00:06:31.163 --> 00:06:32.630
penilaian,

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:34.330
kegelisahan,

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.763
prasangka,

00:06:35.763 --> 00:06:37.063
melupakan,

00:06:37.063 --> 00:06:38.597
dan mengingat.

00:06:38.997 --> 00:06:41.563
Tapi, ada juga cerita-cerita
tentang harapan,

00:06:41.563 --> 00:06:43.263
kekuatan,

00:06:43.263 --> 00:06:44.663
kepekaan,

00:06:44.663 --> 00:06:46.163
keberanian,

00:06:46.163 --> 00:06:48.163
dan kesadaran.

00:06:48.463 --> 00:06:51.797
Cerita mereka mencerminkan
siapa mereka sebenarnya,

00:06:51.797 --> 00:06:54.930
betapa mereka sangat ingin
merasakan ikatan.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:07:00.530
Sekarang, selagi mereka menyampaikan visi
untuk masa depan yang lebih cerah,